# Prompt library

This repository is a prompt and Cursor-rule library. Follow [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) for layout, naming, frontmatter, and required sections.

When adding or editing an entry:

- Put prompts in `prompts/<category>/` and rules in `rules/<category>/`.
- Copy `templates/prompt.md` or `templates/rule.mdc`. Use kebab-case filenames.
- Keep one job per file. Update the category `README.md` index.
- Never commit secrets or one-off chat dumps.
